        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: White Nights (1985 film)\n- People: Taylor Hackford, Twyla Tharp, Mikhail Baryshnikov, Gregory Hines, Jerzy Skolimowski, Helen Mirren, Isabella Rossellini, Phil Collins, Marilyn Martin\n- Songs: \"Separate Lives\"\n- Topics: film soundtracks\n\nFacts:\n- Gregory Oliver Hines was born on February 14, 1946, and was an American dancer, actor, singer, and choreographer.\n- White Nights is a 1985 American drama film directed by Taylor Hackford and choreographed by Twyla Tharp.\n- White Nights stars Mikhail Baryshnikov, Gregory Hines, Jerzy Skolimowski, Helen Mirren, and Isabella Rossellini.\n- \"Separate Lives\" is a 1985 song recorded by Phil Collins and Marilyn Martin.\n- \"Separate Lives\" was featured on the soundtrack to the film White Nights.\n- Gregory Oliver Hines died on August 9, 2003.",
